  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear and side extensions, because of their position, height and scale and the design of the roof, would be intrusive additions, out of scale and character with the existing and surrounding dwellings, creating an overbearing and increased sense of enclosure to the neighbours to the north leading to loss of light, causing harm to living conditions and have a serious and adverse effect on the visual amenity of the locality and wider Stamford Brook Conservation Area. The proposal therefore would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2, CC4, SC7 and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines (2024) and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed side dormer due to its position and design, and the position of the three roof lights would have a detrimental impact on the visual amenity of the locality and wider Stamford Brook Conservation Area. The proposal therefore would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2, CC4, SC7 and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines (2024) and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework."
